        <mxCell id="fle5" edge="1" parent="fl-lane1" source="fl-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;" target="fl-san">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fl-adm" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=13;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;b&gt;⏸ ADMIN REVIEW — the publish graph parks here&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px&quot;&gt;A queue only admins can open. Approve · Request changes · Reject — all three resume the SAME parked run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;It may wait three days, across two deploys and a weekend&lt;/b&gt; — it is a LangGraph interrupt on the Postgres checkpointer. &lt;font color=&quot;#B85450&quot;&gt;(check 6)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;The admin finds the parked thread through platform.submission_index, because the run lives in the author&#39;s schema.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="90" width="1030" x="60" y="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle6" edge="1" parent="1" source="fl-san" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=3;strokeColor=#D79B00;" target="fl-adm">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fl-mkt" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;verticalAlign=middle;" value="&lt;b&gt;platform.listings — the Marketplace&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;The one deliberately global table. What is here: name, description, topology shape,&lt;br&gt;tool refs + risk + approval, required server slugs, score, publisher org name.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;What is NOT here: any credential, who built it, internal URLs, their runs or data.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="100" width="580" x="60" y="530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle7" edge="1" parent="1" source="fl-adm" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#82B366;" target="fl-mkt">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle7l" connectable="0" parent="fle7" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#82B366;" value="approve" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fl-back" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;dashed=1;" value="&lt;b&gt;back to the author, with notes&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;still theirs, still private&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="390" x="700" y="530" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle8" edge="1" parent="1" source="fl-adm" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;dashed=1;strokeColor=#B85450;" target="fl-back">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle8l" connectable="0" parent="fle8" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontColor=#B85450;" value="request changes" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fl-lane2" parent="1" style="swimlane;html=1;startSize=46;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" value="Company B — Helios Systems&#xa;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;schema t_helios — has never seen anything above&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="1030" x="60" y="670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fl-6" parent="fl-lane2" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;6 · Add to my workspace&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;The sanitized config is copied into t_helios as a brand-new agents row.&lt;br&gt;Helios is then walked through connecting each required server slug &lt;b&gt;with their own credentials&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;They never touch the original. Northwind&#39;s tokens never went anywhere.&lt;br&gt;The publisher never sees the installer&#39;s runs.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="65" width="990" x="20" y="55" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle9" edge="1" parent="1" source="fl-mkt" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;strokeColor=#82B366;" target="fl-lane2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fle9l" connectable="0" parent="fle9" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=10;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" value="install — this is why requires_connection names a SLUG, never a token" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" x="0.3" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
